      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T00:02:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t known to be an issue on any other boards, so if we\u0027re going to do this then it should be in board-specific code: `board_process_pd_alert` is a good place for it.\n\nBeyond that however, I don\u0027t think papering over bad performance is a good idea- if we\u0027re not reaching idle for seconds at a time, it\u0027s hard to predict what else might not be working as intended.",
      "revId": "35bf5e9d9e915d8673fb5714f11c20173b213892",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
